\subsection{Model Capability and Vulnerability Profiles}
\label{app:model_profiles}

\begin{figure}[h]
\centering
\includegraphics[width=\columnwidth]{figures/fig_model_radar.pdf}
\caption{Capability profiles of 15 judge models across MMLU and ARC benchmarks. API models cluster at higher accuracy, while local AWQ-quantized models show greater variance. Inter-model capability differences are benchmark-dependent, with some models showing MMLU--ARC divergence exceeding 15 percentage points.}
\label{fig:model_radar}
\end{figure}

The capability landscape of the 15-judge pool (Figure~\ref{fig:model_radar}) shows pronounced API--local separation on MMLU (mean gap: 23~pp) but attenuated separation on ARC (mean gap: 11~pp), reflecting ARC's reasoning-focused format that partially equalizes capability differences across model families.

